{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261111/photo/bkn-20261111124242809-1111_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261111132944\"/><p>疑涉事滾筒紙。(張開裕攝)</p><p>西貢發生工業意外。今晨(11日)11時49分，康定路3號一倉庫一名男工，疑遭重達300公斤印刷用的滾筒紙砸傷腳，其工友聞呼救聲揭發並代為報案。受傷男工清醒由到場救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治理，案件列「工業意外—有人受傷」跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T05:53:15.546090+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T04:42:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:28:05.265989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T05:46:51.813606+00:00","content_hash":"af7558acd6c2dd2fa594f7bc74fa6166d8c95a2df7122b0a7ca8fae7fd70ff6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}